{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Online service is scheduled to end on August 31, 2026 at 7:00PM PDT (UTC-7). An offline version of the game is planned for release in Fall 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/ec5eb9a3a863ee5d3723560b92bdc2a2.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/ec5eb9a3a863ee5d3723560b92bdc2a2.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/ec5eb9a3a863ee5d3723560b92bdc2a2.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2026 AD, a large tectonic disturbance caused mass destruction around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of the destruction, South Western Tokyo split off into the ocean where the seismic activity caused a large spire to rise out of the ocean piercing the island creating a tower-like structure deemed holy by some.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the watchful eye of Uncle Death, madness has spread across the world... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Senpai! I was waiting for you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name is Uncle Death, and I have a feeling we\u2019re going to get along just fine...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple, get to the top of the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/8ac3f57f8f28c8135b2b439b1e72276d.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/8ac3f57f8f28c8135b2b439b1e72276d.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/8ac3f57f8f28c8135b2b439b1e72276d.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let\u2019s reach for the top, Senpai!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way to the top in this chaotic and pulp survival action taking free-to-play to a whole new level. Begin your journey in your underwear and survive by any means necessary while taking advice from Uncle Death, a skateboarding reaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it that a sacred treasure awaits at the top of the Tower of Barbs for those that survive the climb. Many dangers and mysteries remain hidden from the eyes of mankind and await those courageous enough to dare approach the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/22dd8c85a1a0dc3fe4c70670b791b34c.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/22dd8c85a1a0dc3fe4c70670b791b34c.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/22dd8c85a1a0dc3fe4c70670b791b34c.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect and Develop Unique Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players fight through a treacherous tower obtaining various types of weapons and armor while finding creatures and mushrooms to eat in order to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pry weapons and armor from the cold dead grasp of your fallen foes or craft even better gear. Eat mushrooms, frogs, and other odd creatures to keep your strength up or activate special abilities. Strategize when it's best to fight or sneak away to fight another day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may lose your belongings upon death, but death doesn't always have to be the end...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/a31fd240bcf2fc4748d189c79fd49ed7.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/a31fd240bcf2fc4748d189c79fd49ed7.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/a31fd240bcf2fc4748d189c79fd49ed7.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hyper-Violent Rage Moves &amp; Goretastic Kills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When hacking and slashing your foes just isn't enough, you can use ultra violent Rage Moves or Goretastics to finish them off with style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/0897ddcab8b4b016270a22ebc85c23a2.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/0897ddcab8b4b016270a22ebc85c23a2.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/0897ddcab8b4b016270a22ebc85c23a2.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Asynchronous PvP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon death, a player\u2019s \u201cdeath data\u201d is circulated among other player\u2019s games where they will appear as formidable opponents called Haters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need some loot but don't have the time to go exploring the tower yourself? Send one of your Fighters to an unsuspecting enemy, and they will invade their world as a Hunter. These potentially lethal foes can gather up items and resources from an enemy's tower for a set period of time. If they are killed before that, they get sent home crying to their master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TDM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tetsuo brings the Tokyo Death Metro to a platform near you! Join a team, attack your opponents and raid their stash, but keep in mind they can return the favor! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also enjoy bonus rewards during the Tokyo Death Metro Battle Rush Season. We hope to see you enjoying Tokyo Death Metro's Luxury Attack Liner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your body</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop Equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat everything that can be eaten</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re stolen from, steal it back</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and, if you\u2019re killed, kill them back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/c616a7ee2ecd7d8253534cecce63361d.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/c616a7ee2ecd7d8253534cecce63361d.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/c616a7ee2ecd7d8253534cecce63361d.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All-Star Voice Cast</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jukka Hilden</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daveigh Chase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Verne Troyer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traci Lords</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark Hamill</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and MORE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/558ffd32f2eb1b1cf8f5b09227733a63.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/558ffd32f2eb1b1cf8f5b09227733a63.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/558ffd32f2eb1b1cf8f5b09227733a63.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VIP Service</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A VIP elevator service will be available for maximum convenience while slaughtering your foes. Direct Hell also insures your resources if your base is raided in the Tokyo Death Metro. Sign up today for total coverage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/59b98eee3af4040a3ff7c5c977c82daf.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/59b98eee3af4040a3ff7c5c977c82daf.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/59b98eee3af4040a3ff7c5c977c82daf.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Support for Multiple Languages (Including Simplified and Traditional Chinese)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English and Japanese audio and text options are both available. The game also supports text for French, Italian, German, Spanish, Korean, Brazilian Portuguese, and Simplified Chinese, and Traditional Chinese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/4dfa7618675e3cef468334dc927dbe14.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/4dfa7618675e3cef468334dc927dbe14.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/4dfa7618675e3cef468334dc927dbe14.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Oh, One Last Thing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/12a32c6119ec9a75639b871cf7bc2a93.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/12a32c6119ec9a75639b871cf7bc2a93.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/12a32c6119ec9a75639b871cf7bc2a93.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"74003a455e23101b126ccab00845e84792dfee76.jpg","localized_name":"At The End Of The Tunnel","name":"At The End Of The Tunnel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/794600/74003a455e23101b126ccab00845e84792dfee76.jpg"},{"icon":"d630909c37ccb49e8c6130899776fafce9f2306d.jpg","localized_name":"Deserted Town","name":"Deserted Town","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/794600/d630909c37ccb49e8c6130899776fafce9f2306d.jpg"},{"icon":"8326b7c7623ee2bb4325a2b2ff3b0712c089a151.jpg","localized_name":"Dream's End","name":"Dream's End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/794600/8326b7c7623ee2bb4325a2b2ff3b0712c089a151.jpg"},{"icon":"2bd8d4aaa5ed0a115d5064d697e6ffd23a3987dd.jpg","localized_name":"The View From The Top","name":"The View From The Top","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/794600/2bd8d4aaa5ed0a115d5064d697e6ffd23a3987dd.jpg"},{"icon":"473da2df96b32a5659e457c8b44b7634b5a5d80b.jpg","localized_name":"Murder Technician","name":"Murder Technician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/794600/473da2df96b32a5659e457c8b44b7634b5a5d80b.jpg"},{"icon":"53d60d8372c4664d7e4896494c2bd36523a659a8.jpg","localized_name":"LET IT DIE","name":"LET IT DIE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/794600/53d60d8372c4664d7e4896494c2bd36523a659a8.jpg"},{"icon":"89280058131f8618d91dafe8ff7f5f946649443d.jpg","localized_name":"Champion of Barbs","name":"Champion of Barbs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/794600/89280058131f8618d91dafe8ff7f5f946649443d.jpg"},{"icon":"eb79b33c8c003617e9c98da41672c8c6b565f22d.jpg","localized_name":"Impregnable Fortress","name":"Impregnable Fortress","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/794600/eb79b33c8c003617e9c98da41672c8c6b565f22d.jpg"},{"icon":"8dd12ce97b3f9183a8c384d8f48474b037492501.jpg","localized_name":"Flirting Virtuoso","name":"Flirting Virtuoso","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/794600/8dd12ce97b3f9183a8c384d8f48474b037492501.jpg"},{"icon":"b1cc87fd3e1a7ffd4cfcd597337069ca59eb81f4.jpg","localized_name":"Material World","name":"Material World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/794600/b1cc87fd3e1a7ffd4cfcd597337069ca59eb81f4.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/794600?t=1772655611","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772655611","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772655611","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772655611","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Blood and Gore, Nudity, Strong Language, Use of Drugs"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Online service is scheduled to end on August 31, 2026 at 7:00PM PDT (UTC-7). An offline version of the game is planned for release in Fall 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/ec5eb9a3a863ee5d3723560b92bdc2a2.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/ec5eb9a3a863ee5d3723560b92bdc2a2.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/ec5eb9a3a863ee5d3723560b92bdc2a2.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2026 AD, a large tectonic disturbance caused mass destruction around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of the destruction, South Western Tokyo split off into the ocean where the seismic activity caused a large spire to rise out of the ocean piercing the island creating a tower-like structure deemed holy by some.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the watchful eye of Uncle Death, madness has spread across the world... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Senpai! I was waiting for you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name is Uncle Death, and I have a feeling we\u2019re going to get along just fine...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple, get to the top of the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/8ac3f57f8f28c8135b2b439b1e72276d.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/8ac3f57f8f28c8135b2b439b1e72276d.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/8ac3f57f8f28c8135b2b439b1e72276d.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let\u2019s reach for the top, Senpai!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way to the top in this chaotic and pulp survival action taking free-to-play to a whole new level. Begin your journey in your underwear and survive by any means necessary while taking advice from Uncle Death, a skateboarding reaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it that a sacred treasure awaits at the top of the Tower of Barbs for those that survive the climb. Many dangers and mysteries remain hidden from the eyes of mankind and await those courageous enough to dare approach the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/22dd8c85a1a0dc3fe4c70670b791b34c.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/22dd8c85a1a0dc3fe4c70670b791b34c.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/22dd8c85a1a0dc3fe4c70670b791b34c.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect and Develop Unique Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players fight through a treacherous tower obtaining various types of weapons and armor while finding creatures and mushrooms to eat in order to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pry weapons and armor from the cold dead grasp of your fallen foes or craft even better gear. Eat mushrooms, frogs, and other odd creatures to keep your strength up or activate special abilities. Strategize when it's best to fight or sneak away to fight another day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may lose your belongings upon death, but death doesn't always have to be the end...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/a31fd240bcf2fc4748d189c79fd49ed7.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/a31fd240bcf2fc4748d189c79fd49ed7.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/a31fd240bcf2fc4748d189c79fd49ed7.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hyper-Violent Rage Moves &amp; Goretastic Kills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When hacking and slashing your foes just isn't enough, you can use ultra violent Rage Moves or Goretastics to finish them off with style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/0897ddcab8b4b016270a22ebc85c23a2.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/0897ddcab8b4b016270a22ebc85c23a2.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/0897ddcab8b4b016270a22ebc85c23a2.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Asynchronous PvP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon death, a player\u2019s \u201cdeath data\u201d is circulated among other player\u2019s games where they will appear as formidable opponents called Haters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need some loot but don't have the time to go exploring the tower yourself? Send one of your Fighters to an unsuspecting enemy, and they will invade their world as a Hunter. These potentially lethal foes can gather up items and resources from an enemy's tower for a set period of time. If they are killed before that, they get sent home crying to their master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TDM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tetsuo brings the Tokyo Death Metro to a platform near you! Join a team, attack your opponents and raid their stash, but keep in mind they can return the favor! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also enjoy bonus rewards during the Tokyo Death Metro Battle Rush Season. We hope to see you enjoying Tokyo Death Metro's Luxury Attack Liner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your body</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop Equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat everything that can be eaten</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re stolen from, steal it back</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and, if you\u2019re killed, kill them back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/c616a7ee2ecd7d8253534cecce63361d.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/c616a7ee2ecd7d8253534cecce63361d.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/c616a7ee2ecd7d8253534cecce63361d.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All-Star Voice Cast</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jukka Hilden</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daveigh Chase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Verne Troyer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traci Lords</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark Hamill</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and MORE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/558ffd32f2eb1b1cf8f5b09227733a63.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/558ffd32f2eb1b1cf8f5b09227733a63.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/558ffd32f2eb1b1cf8f5b09227733a63.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VIP Service</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A VIP elevator service will be available for maximum convenience while slaughtering your foes. Direct Hell also insures your resources if your base is raided in the Tokyo Death Metro. Sign up today for total coverage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/59b98eee3af4040a3ff7c5c977c82daf.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/59b98eee3af4040a3ff7c5c977c82daf.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/59b98eee3af4040a3ff7c5c977c82daf.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Support for Multiple Languages (Including Simplified and Traditional Chinese)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English and Japanese audio and text options are both available. The game also supports text for French, Italian, German, Spanish, Korean, Brazilian Portuguese, and Simplified Chinese, and Traditional Chinese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/4dfa7618675e3cef468334dc927dbe14.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/4dfa7618675e3cef468334dc927dbe14.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/4dfa7618675e3cef468334dc927dbe14.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Oh, One Last Thing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/12a32c6119ec9a75639b871cf7bc2a93.poster.avif?t=1772655611\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/12a32c6119ec9a75639b871cf7bc2a93.webm?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/extras/12a32c6119ec9a75639b871cf7bc2a93.mp4?t=1772655611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["GRASSHOPPER MANUFACTURE INC.","SUPERTRICK GAMES, Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/794600/header.jpg?t=1772655611","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2017 GungHo Online Entertainment America, Inc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/794600/181948/89b8286acfec2b53ee0bf4620888a613305b086d/1750584930/dash_av1.mpd?t=1536806589","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/794600/181948/89b8286acfec2b53ee0bf4620888a613305b086d/1750584930/dash_h264.mpd?t=1536806589","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/794600/181948/89b8286acfec2b53ee0bf4620888a613305b086d/1750584930/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=153680